        "created_at": "2013-08-13T20:57:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>With Team Leader Tachyon you're sacrificing the ability to put cards into her trash.&nbsp; Yes, you COULD Research Grant when you draw it, but that would mean you gaining two cards at the cost of not letting everyone draw a card.&nbsp; It makes her play more like Legacy than anything:&nbsp; Buffing other heroes at the cost of not dealing as much damage herself.</p>",
