      {
        "id": 70771,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-13T21:34:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Reckless\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/48/2467_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Reckless:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>With Team Leader Tachyon you're sacrificing the ability to put cards into her trash.&nbsp; Yes, you COULD Research Grant when you draw it, but that would mean you gaining two cards at the cost of everyone drawing a card.&nbsp; It makes her play more like Legacy than anything:&nbsp; Buffing other heroes at the cost of not dealing as much damage herself.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah but that \"buff\" is insanely good. &nbsp;It is really hard to lose with a solid team and a TLT.</p>",
