      {
        "id": 70776,
        "name": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
        "username": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/{size}/1967_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-13T23:34:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Also worth noting (and something I only figured out recently) is that unlike Burst of Speed, TLT forces you to draw a card if used, so if you're helping others draw more then you may have to lose your bursty trash. It's a tiny thing, and with most games I'd disregard this, but this being GTG I'd be very surprised if this was coincidental.</p>",
