      {
        "id": 70780,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-14T21:05:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah for my purposes I was meaning better as Increases the overall likelihood of a win for the team, which she does provide. &nbsp;Much like I imagine Young Legacy will have a lower win percentage than Legacy, That base power will almost never never do enough to offset the damage the other heroes don't do, esp. with DR, but it lets that great card set be on a damage dealer, and in some fights and on some teams that will work much better.</p><p>Those two promo cards definitely change the role of the hero.</p>",
